<div id="body" class="mktoText" style="font-family: Helvetica, Arial, Sans-Serif; padding:10px;"> 
<div>
Hi&nbsp;{{lead.First Name:default=there}},
</div> 
<div>
<br />I was researching {{company.Company Name:default=your company}} and think you could benefit from 
<strong><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/travel" target="_blank" id="">Flywire</a></strong>'s payment platform. Flywire works with hundreds of travel companies to reduce rates on payment fees by a full percentage point or more.&nbsp;We also provide our clients and their global customers the most cost-effective and streamlined ways to pay (credit card, bank transfer, Paypal, etc.) in 120+ currencies.
<br />
<br />I would love to connect with whoever handles your payment processes to see if Flywire can add some value to your business. Would that be you?
<br />
<br />Please let me know if you'd be open to a 20 minute conversation to see if Flywire can help save your business time and money, or if there's someone else on the team I can connect with. You can schedule time with me directly 
<strong><a href="https://meet.yesware.com/me/charlie-dreher/30min" target="_blank">here</a></strong>.&nbsp;
<br />
<br />Best,
<br />
</div> 
<div>
Charlie
</div> 
<div>
<br />
</div> 
